# HR-SaaS-Customer-Analytics-Excel
Analyzed platform engagement and customer health metrics to identify retention risks and growth opportunities within recruitment-focused accounts.
HR SaaS Customer Analytics
Project Overview

This project analyzes customer engagement and account health data from an HR SaaS platform to identify potential retention risks and account improvement opportunities.

Objectives
Analyze customer platform engagement.
Evaluate account health.
Identify accounts with higher churn risk.
Analyze customer support activity.
Explore account usage patterns.
Key Metrics Analyzed
Account Type
Contract Plan
Logins per Week
Jobs Posted per Month
Open Tickets
Health Score
Churn Risk
Upsell Opportunity
Analysis Performed
1. Customer Support Analysis

Analyzed open support tickets across customer accounts to identify accounts requiring additional attention.

2. Platform Engagement Analysis

Compared login activity across different account types and contract plans.

3. Account Health Analysis

Analyzed health scores to understand overall customer account performance.

4. Recruitment Activity Analysis

Analyzed the number of jobs posted per month to understand platform utilization.

5. Churn Risk Analysis

Identified accounts with different levels of churn risk based on account health and engagement.

6. Growth Opportunity Analysis

Explored accounts with potential opportunities for additional HR SaaS services.

Tools Used
Microsoft Excel
Pivot Tables
Data Analysis
Dataset

The dataset contains 15 customer accounts with information related to platform engagement, account health, support activity, and retention indicators.
